\" src=\"/img/project/dr-jain-karol-bagh/dr-jain-karol-bagh/final-01.avif\" alt=\"Home design in Karol Bagh, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Karol Bagh Home\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-arun-ashok-vihar/mr-arun-ashok-vihar/3.avif\" alt=\"Living room in Ashok Vihar, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Ashok Vihar Living Room\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you work as an interior architect for showroom design near Pitampura?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. We design showrooms in Pitampura, Netaji Subhash Place, Rohini and other commercial areas of North and West Delhi.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How do you make a showroom stand out in a busy market?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">A clear façade, strong signage, a bright entry and a hero display that is visible from the road draw people in.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can you design a showroom with an office inside?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. We separate the selling floor from the office, store and staff areas so customers see a clean, focused display.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why hire an interior architect for showroom design and not just a fit-out team?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Planning decides how customers move, what they see first and how products are lit. A fit-out team builds the plan, so the plan has to be right.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Help Shoppers Say Yes</h2>\n            <p>A good store makes buying feel easy and enjoyable. A skilled interior architect for showroom design shapes every step of that journey.</p><p>Planning a showroom in Pitampura or NSP? <a href=\"/pitampura/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a> to discuss your store.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}